     "text": "Discrete-time frequencies range over $\\omega \\in [-\\pi, \\pi]$ rad/sample, repeating periodically every $2\\pi$. On the complex $z$-plane ($z = e^{j\\omega}$ along the unit circle $\\vert z\\vert = 1$):"
