      "**Digital Filters:** Defined on discrete-time sequences. Because sampling discretizes time, the spectrum $H(e^{j\\omega})$ is **strictly periodic** with fundamental period $2\\pi$. Every passband, transition band, and stopband repeats identically every $2\\pi$ radians."
