     "t": "code",
     "text": "+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  PAGE 18 - BOTTOM LEFT (SLIDE 071)                                       |\n|                                                                          |\n|  * Understanding the concept of Eigen Value and Eigen function           |\n|    with the help of D.T.F.T. :                                           |\n|    =============================================                         |\n|                                                                          |\n|              X(e^{j\\omega})        H(e^{j\\omega})                        |\n|                   x[n] ---->[  h[n]  ]----> y[n] = x[n] * h[n]           |\n|                                             Y(e^{j\\omega}) = X(e^{j\\omega}) H(e^{j\\omega})|\n|                                                                          |\n|        If LTI s/s is stable \\implies h[n] is ab. summable                |\n|                                 \\Downarrow                               |\n|                             H(z) includes |z| = 1 unity circle           |\n|                                 \\Downarrow                               |\n|                             H(z)|_{z=e^{j\\omega}} = H(e^{j\\omega})       |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+"
