     "text": "Let $x[n] = A \\sin(\\omega_0 n + \\phi) = \\frac{A}{2j} e^{j(\\omega_0 n + \\phi)} - \\frac{A}{2j} e^{-j(\\omega_0 n + \\phi)}$.\nPassing through $H(e^{j\\omega})$:"
