     "t": "p",
     "text": "As derived in Slides 073 and 074, a sinusoidal input is composed of two distinct exponential eigenfunctions with frequencies $+\\omega_0$ and $-\\omega_0$. Unless their corresponding eigenvalues are identical, their linear combination changes waveform (phase shifted and/or distorted)."
