     "t": "code",
     "text": "+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  PAGE 21 - TOP RIGHT (SLIDE 082)                                         |\n|                                                                          |\n|  Q.  x[n] --->+--->[Unit delay]--->[Unit delay]--+                       |\n|               |      x[n-1]          x[n-2]      |                       |\n|              [5]                                [5]      Type of Filter? |\n|               |                                  |       H(e^{j\\omega}) = ?|\n|             5x[n]                             5x[n-2]    H(z) = ?        |\n|               |                                  |                       |\n|               +------------->(+)-----------------+                       |\n|                               ^ (-)                                      |\n|                               |                                          |\n|                              y[n]                                        |\n|                                                                          |\n|      y[n] = 5x[n] - 5x[n-2]                                              |\n|      Y(e^{j\\omega}) = 5 X(e^{j\\omega}) - 5 e^{-j 2\\omega} X(e^{j\\omega}) |\n|      H(e^{j\\omega}) = 5 [ 1 - e^{-j 2\\omega} ]                           |\n|      H(z) = 5 [ 1 - z^{-2} ]                                             |\n|                                                                          |\n|      z = 1  (\\omega = 0)   : H(z)|_{z=1}  = 5(1 - 1) = 0   (Blocks DC)   |\n|      z = -1 (\\omega = \\pi) : H(z)|_{z=-1} = 5(1 - 1) = 0   (Blocks HF)   |\n|      z = j  (\\omega = \\pi/2): H(z)|_{z=j} = 5(1 - j^{-2}) = 10 \\neq 0    |\n|                                            (Passes mid freq)             |\n|                                                                          |\n|      \\implies BAND-PASS FILTER (B.P.F.)                                  |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+"
