     "t": "p",
     "text": "**Audit Context & Scope:**\n- **Source Pages:** `page_0049.png` through `page_0056.png` (Slides 193\u2013224)\n- **Core Topics Audited:** Normalized DFT Duality, Double DFT Operator Invariance, Circular Convolution vs. Linear Convolution, Circulant Matrix Formulation, Circular Time-Shift & Frequency Modulation Properties, Computation of Exponential Fourier Series Coefficients ($c_k$) via DFT, Parseval's Energy Theorem Across Signal Domains, Continuous & Discrete Correlation Theory, Discrete Circular Correlation & Wiener\u2013Khinchin Theorem, Distortion in LTI Systems (Magnitude vs. Phase Distortion), Distortionless LTI Conditions, Phase Delay ($t_p$) vs. Group Delay ($t_g$).\n- **Specialized FFT Module:** Direct DFT Computational Bottleneck, Radix-2 Decimation-in-Time (DIT-FFT), Butterfly Architecture, Bit-Reversal Permutation, Radix-2 Decimation-in-Frequency (DIF-FFT), DIT vs. DIF Comparison Matrix, and Composite-$N$ / Mixed-Radix FFT Overview."
